Without his data, again,
this would not have happened,

00:49:42.190 --> 00:49:43.559
as well as Felipe Hoffa.

00:49:43.559 --> 00:49:45.100
And lastly, if you
want to, if you're

00:49:45.100 --> 00:49:47.860
interested in machine learning
and want to learn more,

00:49:47.860 --> 00:49:50.980
feel free to check out
